Third-Party Dataset License Notice
==================================

Dataset: Vowel Recognition (Deterding Data)
Distributed object: vowel (data/vowel.rda)
Source file: vowel-context.data

Source and attribution
----------------------

Original dataset creators:
David Deterding, Mahesan Niranjan, and Tony Robinson.

Dataset citation:
Deterding, D., Niranjan, M., & Robinson, T. (1988).
Connectionist Bench (Vowel Recognition - Deterding Data) [Dataset].
UCI Machine Learning Repository.
https://doi.org/10.24432/C58P4S

The vowel-context.data version adds explicit contextual information
about speakers and was prepared by Peter Turney. See the accompanying
vowel-context.names file and Turney (1993), "Robust Classification
With Context-Sensitive Features."

