Changes made for the dppca package
----------------------------------

- Imported vowel-context.data into an R data frame.
- Assigned descriptive variable names.
- Converted the categorical codes for training/test split, speaker,
  sex, and vowel class to factors.
- Retained the numeric acoustic measurements without alteration.

Package code
------------

This notice concerns the third-party Vowel dataset only. The dppca
package code is licensed separately as stated in the package DESCRIPTION
and its LICENSE file.
